@direction TB

@preset minimal

Modified FarmBot Web Interface [interface]
  -> Local FarmBot Web App [service]

Local FarmBot Web App [service]
  -> Rails API [service]
  -> Database [database]

Rails API [service]
  -> Message Broker [service]

Database [database]

Message Broker [service]
  -> FarmBot OS / Raspberry Pi 4 [hardware]

FarmBot OS / Raspberry Pi 4 [hardware]
  -> Custom Experiments [custom]
  -> Farmduino [hardware]

Custom Experiments [custom]
  -> Physical FarmBot [hardware]

Farmduino [hardware]
  -> Physical FarmBot [hardware]

Physical FarmBot [hardware]
  :: Motors / Camera
